To run a batch of tests.
-------------------------------------------------
-configure figure one to many tests in test.cfg
	-comments will not work. TODO
	-no blank lines. TODO
	-payload size will only work for 1K or 32K. TODO
-run ssh-copy-id to the publisher machine.
-configure in testme_sub.sh
	-SSH_USER_PUB
	-JALOP_HOME_PUB
-configure
	-test-input/jald.cfg with proper IPs or hostnames
	-test-input/jal_subscribe.cfg with proper IPs or hostnames
-For JJNL 
	-copy your jar into test-input/PERF-TEST/JJNL
	-configure test-input/PERF-TEST/JJNL/sampleSubscriber.json
	-in your test.cfg tls=on|off, the program will toggle "configureTLS" in the .json file
-run from the subscriber jalop home directory
	-.test-input/PERF-TEST/testme_sub.sh .test-input/PERF-TEST/test.cfg
